@startuml embedded_sequence_no_storage
title Embedded Page Agent - Sequence Diagram (No Storage Lifelines)
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
actor "Orchestrator" as Orchestrator
control "EmbeddedPageAgent" as Agent
participant "Prompt compiler" as Prompt
participant "embedded MCP tools" as Tools
participant "Gemini model" as LLM
participant "_normalize_embedded_output" as Normalize

Orchestrator -> Agent: run(embedded/player URL, embedded handoff)
Agent -> Prompt: Compile embedded prompt,\nplayer-only contract, handoff
Prompt --> Agent: Layered prompt
Agent -> Tools: Open embedded profile
Agent -> Tools: Bootstrap navigate/context\nand inspect_embedded
Tools --> Agent: Frame tree, activation targets,\nsource controls, media state

loop each same-player source/control
  Agent -> LLM: Player-local evidence and targets
  LLM --> Agent: Source activation or harvest plan
  Agent -> Tools: Dismiss overlay or recover drift if needed
  Agent -> Tools: Activate frame-local play/source target
  Tools --> Agent: Updated player/media state
  Agent -> Tools: screenshot + harvest/capture streams
  Tools --> Agent: Stream candidates and diagnostics
end

Agent -> Normalize: Normalize servers, streams,\nplayer state, channel metadata
Normalize --> Agent: Clean embedded payload
Agent --> Orchestrator: ExtractionResult(streams or no-stream evidence)
@enduml
